ormalPrice":32.9}},{"brand":null,"description":"Inkontinen\u010dn\u00ed vlo\u017eky TENA Maxi Night poskytuj\u00ed neuv\u011b\u0159itelnou ochranu pro \u017eeny. Maj\u00ed extra d\u00e9lku a \u0161\u00ed\u0159ku v zadn\u00ed \u010d\u00e1sti pro vynikaj\u00edc\u00ed kryt\u00ed, kter\u00e9 nab\u00edz\u00ed optim\u00e1ln\u00ed spolehlivost p\u0159i poloze vle\u017ee. Jsou vhodn\u00e9 pro st\u0159edn\u00ed a\u017e t\u011b\u017ek\u00fd \u00fanik mo\u010di zvl\u00e1\u0161t\u011b v noci. Maxim\u00e1ln\u00ed absorpce tam, kde ji nejv\u00edce pot\u0159ebujete, je z\u00e1rukou rychl\u00e9ho odvodu vlhkosti z poko\u017eky. Udr\u017euje v\u00e1s v suchu a pokro\u010dil\u00e9 sv\u011b\u017e\u00ed mikroperli\u010dky omezuj\u00ed ne\u017e\u00e1douc\u00ed z\u00e1pach. D\u00edky m\u011bkk\u00fdm, elastick\u00fdm stran\u00e1m se vlo\u017eka pro \u00fanik mo\u010di p\u0159izp\u016fsob\u00ed tvaru va\u0161eho t\u011bla. Je velmi pohodln\u00e1 a chr\u00e1n\u00ed p\u0159ed \u00faniky a z\u00e1pachem \u2013 pro klid na mysli a dobr\u00fd no\u010dn\u00ed sp\u00e1nek. Pozorn\u011b si p\u0159e\u010dt\u011bte informace na obalu.                                O spr\u00e1vn\u00e9m pou\u017eit\u00ed se pora\u010fte se sv\u00fdm l\u00e9ka\u0159em, nebo l\u00e9k\u00e1rn\u00edkem. Inkontinen\u010dn\u00ed vlo\u017eka TENA Lady Maxi Night je zdarvotnick\u00fd prost\u0159edek ur\u010den\u00fd pro vn\u011bj\u0161\u00ed pou\u017e\u00edt\u00ed p\u0159i \u00faniku mo\u010di.","contains":"Hygienick\u00fd \/ inkontinen\u010dn\u00ed prost\u0159edek \u2013 sav\u00e9 j\u00e1dro (celul\u00f3za + superabsorp\u010dn\u00ed polymer SAP), netkan\u00e1 textilie (polypropylen), polyetylenov\u00e1 f\u00f3lie, lepidla.","imgDetail":"https:\/\/gapi.globus.cz\/OnlineAsset\/3\/asset?assetID=f6e312fb-19af-44ee-9fdf-8dbb5dd40b0f&type=1","allergens":[],"nutritionValues":[],"producer":"ESSITY CZECH REPUBLIC S.R.O.","producerId":"30162","storage":"Spot\u0159ebujte do 3 let od data v\u00fdroby.","productCategories":["cls_czr_64041417","cls_czr_womens_intimate_hygiene","cls_czr_drugstore_and_cosmetics","cls_czr_click_and_collect"],"hasFictiveStock":false,"originalRebateIds":null,"sellUnitSizeText":"6ks","countriesOfOrigin":["NL"],"commonBrand":{"id":"28500","name":"Tena"},"ageLimitation":null,"baseVariantQuantity":1,"articleType":0,"billName":"TENA LADY MAXI","pointRelevant":false,"regulatedName":"","otherLegalRequirements":"","containsMicronutrients":false,"qcommSell":true,"micronutrients":[],"matlType":"ZHAW","valClass":"Z300","ean":["7322541120850"],"vanr":"02128943009","productTagIds":[],"warengroup":"726W3111","name":"Tena Lady Maxi Night inkontinen\u010dn\u00ed vlo\u017eky","productInHouse":{"globusBonusCredit":null,"actualPrice":89.9,"originalPrice":null,"discountPercentage":null,"priceValidFrom":"2026-09-30T00:00:00.000+02:00","priceValidTo":"2026-10-27T23:59:59.000+01:00","houseNumber":4005,"houseName":"Globus \u010cR, v.o.s. \u010cakovice ","placements":[{"placement":"32401060","facing":1,"presentationType":0,"presentationStock":1,"planogramKey":"329090","name":"Damska_hygiena1_vata_5RJ_05_Cako","category":"Hygiena","subcategory":"Damska hygiena, vatove produkty","department":"Drogerie"}],"modified":"2026-09-30T13:38:29.000+02:00","stockAmount":6,"minimumPresentationStock":1,"priceTagId":"12","priceType":"VKA0","comparisonPrice":14.98,"comparisonSaleUnitSizeText":"1,00 ks","baseComparisonPrice":14.98,"baseComparisonSaleUnitSizeText":"1,00 ks","securityTag":false,"availability":"A","blickPunkt":true,"customerClubDiscounts":[],"modifiedStockAmount":"2026-10-05T18:25:59.000+02:00","bonusProgramPrice":null,"GraphicId":121,"Color":"1","isActive":true},"unitId":"KS","unitAmount":6,"placementOrder":0,"imgIcon":"https:\/\/gapi.globus.cz\/OnlineAsset\/3\/asset?assetID=f6e312fb-19af-44ee-9fdf-8dbb5dd40b0f&type=3","imgThumbnail":"https:\/\/gapi.globus.cz\/OnlineAsset\/3\/asset?assetID=f6e312fb-19af-44ee-9fdf-8dbb5dd40b0f&type=2","alias":["p\u00e9\u010de pro \u017eeny","zdravotn\u00ed vlo\u017eky"],"modified":"2026-10-06T15:35:33.000+02:00","imageStepURL":null,"priceCheckerHasPicture":false,"stepID":null,"rabatNumber":null,"originalRebateId":null,"IsBaseVariant":false,"ribbon":[],"badges":[],"calculatedPrice":{"currentPrice":89.9,"normalPrice":0}},{"brand":{"brandId":"0","name":"Norm\u00e1ln\u00ed"},"description":"Tampony KOTEX\u00ae nab\u00edz\u00ed jedine\u010dnou ochranu d\u00edky speci\u00e1ln\u011b tvarovan\u00fdm vl\u00e1kn\u016fm z visk\u00f3zy a z\u00e1rove\u0148 maxim\u00e1ln\u00ed svobodu pohybu, pohodl\u00ed a spolehlivost p\u0159i pou\u017eit\u00ed. Vl\u00e1kna poskytuj\u00ed vy\u0161\u0161\u00ed absorpci d\u00edky trojlalo\u010dn\u00e9mu pr\u016f\u0159ezu vl\u00e1kna. Jedine\u010dn\u00fd mechanismus KOTEX\u00ae \"oto\u010d a otev\u0159i\/Twist&Open\" pro pohodln\u00e9 rozbalov\u00e1n\u00ed tamp\u00f3nu. Spolehliv\u00e1 ochrana p\u0159i siln\u00e9 menstruaci. 32 ks v balen\u00ed.<br><br>VAROV\u00c1N\u00cd: Syndrom toxick\u00e9ho \u0161oku (TSS) je spojen s pou\u017e\u00edv\u00e1n\u00edm tampon\u016f. TSS je velmi vz\u00e1cn\u00e9, ale z\u00e1va\u017en\u00e9 onemocn\u011bn\u00ed, kter\u00e9 m\u016f\u017ee zp\u016fsobit smrteln\u00e9 n\u00e1sledky. Pe\u010dliv\u011b si p\u0159e\u010dt\u011bte pokyny uvnit\u0159 balen\u00ed o bezpe\u010dn\u00e9m pou\u017e\u00edv\u00e1n\u00ed tampon\u016f.<br>N\u00e1hl\u00e1 hore\u010dka (>39C\/102F), zvracen\u00ed, pr\u016fjem, mdloby nebo t\u00e9m\u011b\u0159 mdloby p\u0159i n\u00e1hl\u00e9m pohybu, z\u00e1vrat\u011b, bolest v krku nebo sp\u00e1lenina od slunce jako vyr\u00e1\u017eka mohou b\u00fdt vz\u00e1cn\u00e9, ale z\u00e1va\u017en\u00e9 onemocn\u011bn\u00ed - syndrom toxick\u00e9ho \u0161oku (TSS). TSS, po\u010d\u00ednaje p\u0159\u00edznaky podobn\u00fdmi ch\u0159ipce, m\u016f\u017ee rychle p\u0159ej\u00edt do onemocn\u011bn\u00ed, kter\u00e9 m\u016f\u017ee b\u00fdt smrteln\u00e9. M\u00e1te-li jak\u00e9koli dotazy, pora\u010fte se se sv\u00fdm l\u00e9ka\u0159em. Pokud se tyto p\u0159\u00edznaky objev\u00ed, vyjm\u011bte tampon a okam\u017eit\u011b kontaktujte sv\u00e9ho l\u00e9ka\u0159e. Plastov\u00e9 obaly - nebezpe\u010d\u00ed udu\u0161en\u00ed. Uchov\u00e1vejte obal mimo dosah d\u011bt\u00ed. <br>Obecn\u00e9 na\u0159\u00edzen\u00ed o bezpe\u010dnosti v\u00fdrobk\u016f [2023\/988] (EU GPSR): Kimberly-Clark B.V., Copernicuslaan 35, 6716 BM Ede, Nizozemsko \/ Ochrann\u00e9 zn\u00e1mky Kimberly-Clark Worldwide, Inc. nebo p\u0159idru\u017een\u00fdch spole\u010dnost\u00ed. \u00a9 Ochrann\u00e9 zn\u00e1mky zna\u010dky KCWW (HUGGIES\u00ae, KLEENEX\u00ae LIDIE\u00ae KOTEX\u00ae) \/ www.kimberly-clark.com","contains":null,"imgDetail":"https:\/\/gapi.globus.cz\/OnlineAsset\/3\/asset?assetID=9118a8d5-b638-4347-b6dd-4d275f73b6fd&type=1","allergens":[],"nutritionValues":[],"producer":"KIMBERLY-CLARK S.R.O.","producerId":"37043","storage":"Spot\u0159ebujte do 3 let od data v\u00fdroby na obalu.","productCategories":[],"hasFictiveStock":false,"originalRebateIds":null,"sellUnitSizeText":"32 ks","countriesOfOrigin":["CZ"],"commonBrand":{"id":"11085","name":"Kotex"},"ageLimitation":null,"baseVariantQuantity":1,"articleType":0,"billName":"KC KOTEX SUPER  32KS","pointRelevant":false,"regulatedName":"","otherLegalRequirements":"","containsMicronutrients":false,"qcommSell":null,"micronutrients":[],"matlType":"ZHAW","valClass":"Z300","ean":["5029053523217"],"vanr":"00680443005","productTagIds":[],"warengroup":"645W6113","name":"KOTEX Tampony Super 32ks","productInHouse":{"globusBonusCredit":null,"actualPrice":89.9,"originalPrice":null,"discountPercentage":null,"priceValidFrom":"2026-09-30T00:00:00.000+02:00","priceValidTo":"2026-10-27T23:59:59.000+01:00","houseNumber":4005,"houseName":"Globus \u010cR, v.o.s. \u010cakovice ","placements":null,"modified":"2026-09-30T13:38:28.000+02:00","stockAmount":24,"minimumPresentationStock":0,"priceTagId":"12","priceType":"VKA0","comparisonPrice":2.81,"comparisonSaleUnitSizeText":"1,00 ks","baseComparisonPrice":2.81,"baseComparisonSaleUnitSizeText"