hern\u00ed plochu a pomoc\u00ed p\u00e1\u010dek ji udr\u017euje ve h\u0159e. C\u00edlem je trefovat ter\u010de a p\u0159ek\u00e1\u017eky. Hr\u00e1\u010di mohou st\u0159\u00eddat r\u00e1ny a sna\u017eit se dos\u00e1hnout co nejvy\u0161\u0161\u00edho sk\u00f3re, kter\u00e9 zobrazuje velk\u00fd elektronick\u00fd LED displej. Sk\u00f3re se ukl\u00e1d\u00e1 automaticky a ka\u017ed\u00fd nov\u00fd pokus inspiruje dal\u0161\u00ed souboj o rekord. <br><br>Barevn\u00e9 sv\u011bteln\u00e9 efekty, bonusov\u00e9 tunely a zvukov\u00e1 kulisa umoc\u0148uj\u00ed atmosf\u00e9ru skute\u010dn\u00e9 herny. D\u00edky bateri\u00edm m\u016f\u017eete hr\u00e1t kdekoli a kdykoli!<br><br>Hra Mini Arcade Pinball - Minecraft obsahuje: kompaktn\u00ed pinballovou plochu s bumpery, elektronick\u00e9 sk\u00f3re s velk\u00fdm LED displejem a automatick\u00fdm detekov\u00e1n\u00edm ztracen\u00e9 koule, v\u00fdrazn\u00e9 barevn\u00e9 LED osv\u011btlen\u00ed a zvukov\u00e9 efekty, koule pro pinball, n\u00e1vod v \u010desk\u00e9m a slovensk\u00e9m jazyce.<br>Baterie: 3 x 1,5V typ AA (nejsou sou\u010d\u00e1st\u00ed balen\u00ed)","contains":null,"imgDetail":"https:\/\/gapi.globus.cz\/OnlineAsset\/3\/asset?assetID=9c3f4bf5-5129-4ff5-9624-1e9ecc659182&type=1","allergens":[],"nutritionValues":[],"producer":"ALBI \u010cESK\u00c1 REPUBLIKA A.S.","producerId":"36891","storage":null,"productCategories":["cls_czr_tables_desks_games","cls_czr_family_party_games","cls_czr_toys","cls_czr_the_world_of_children","cls_czr_click_and_collect"],"hasFictiveStock":false,"originalRebateIds":null,"sellUnitSizeText":null,"countriesOfOrigin":["CN"],"commonBrand":{"id":"1056","name":"Albi"},"ageLimitation":null,"baseVariantQuantity":1,"articleType":0,"billName":"MINECRAFT PINBALL","pointRelevant":false,"regulatedName":"","otherLegalRequirements":"","containsMicronutrients":false,"qcommSell":null,"micronutrients":[],"matlType":"ZHAW","valClass":"Z300","ean":["8590228114167"],"vanr":"02388112009","productTagIds":[],"warengroup":