8a-65d99a097936&type=2","alias":[],"modified":"2026-10-08T14:33:19.000+02:00","imageStepURL":null,"priceCheckerHasPicture":false,"stepID":null,"rabatNumber":null,"originalRebateId":null,"IsBaseVariant":false,"ribbon":{"vSale":{"display":true,"label":"-18 %"}},"badges":{"vCZProduct":{"display":true}},"calculatedPrice":{"currentPrice":44.9,"normalPrice":54.9}},{"brand":null,"description":"Pot\u011b\u0161te mal\u00e9 fanou\u0161ky LEGO\u00ae halloweenskou stavebnic\u00ed Pick-up s halloweensk\u00fdmi d\u00fdn\u011bmi (40822). Sou\u010d\u00e1st\u00ed je model pick-upu \u0159\u00edzen\u00e9ho minifigurkou farm\u00e1\u0159e, kter\u00e1 p\u0159ev\u00e1\u017e\u00ed velkou vy\u0159ez\u00e1vanou d\u00fdni. Otev\u0159ete horn\u00ed \u010d\u00e1st d\u00fdn\u011b a ulo\u017ete do n\u00ed dal\u0161\u00ed d\u00fdni a lebku. Kluci a holky od 8 let si halloweenskou hra\u010dku m\u016f\u017eou vystavit nebo si s n\u00ed p\u0159ehr\u00e1vat stra\u0161ideln\u00e1 halloweensk\u00e1 dobrodru\u017estv\u00ed.  \u2022 Halloweensk\u00e1 stavebnice LEGO\u00ae \u2013 Pot\u011b\u0161te kluky a holky od 8 let halloweenskou stavebnic\u00ed Pick-up s halloweensk\u00fdmi d\u00fdn\u011bmi (40822)<br> \u2022 Na hran\u00ed i vystaven\u00ed \u2013 Model pick-upu s velkou halloweenskou d\u00fdn\u00ed m\u00e1 otev\u00edrac\u00ed horn\u00ed \u010d\u00e1st pro ulo\u017een\u00ed dal\u0161\u00ed d\u00fdn\u011b a lebky a nechyb\u00ed minifigurka farm\u00e1\u0159e<br> \u2022 Halloweensk\u00e1 dekorace v podob\u011b d\u00fdn\u011b \u2013 Tato stavebnice LEGO\u00ae p\u0159edstavuje z\u00e1bavnou halloweenskou dekoraci a hod\u00ed se do ka\u017ed\u00e9 m\u00edstnosti<br> \u2022 Sv\u00e1te\u010dn\u00ed z\u00e1bava s celou rodinou \u2013 Tato stavebnice halloweensk\u00e9 dekorace p\u0159in\u00e1\u0161\u00ed d\u011btem i dosp\u011bl\u00fdm mo\u017enost spole\u010dn\u011b si u\u017e\u00edt halloweenskou z\u00e1bavu a stavitelsk\u00fd projekt<br> \u2022 Halloweensk\u00fd d\u00e1rek pro d\u011bti \u2013 Tato stavebnice s pick-upem a d\u00fdn\u00ed p\u0159edstavuje z\u00e1bavn\u00fd d\u00e1rek nebo odm\u011bnu, se kterou si d\u011bti u\u017eij\u00ed Halloween<br> \u2022 Rozm\u011bry \u2013 Tato stavebnice se skl\u00e1d\u00e1 ze 177 d\u00edlk\u016f a sou\u010d\u00e1st\u00ed je model pick-upu, kter\u00fd m\u011b\u0159\u00ed p\u0159es 8 cm na v\u00fd\u0161ku, 6 cm na d\u00e9lku a 10 cm na \u0161\u00ed\u0159ku<br> \u2022 <br> \u2022","contains":null,"imgDetail":"https:\/\/gapi.globus.cz\/OnlineAsset\/3\/asset?assetID=1730eb20-b3f2-48a6-97df-8f5679af55fb&type=1","allergens":[],"nutritionValues":[],"producer":"LEGO TRADING S.R.O.","producerId":"39346","storage":null,"productCategories":["cls_czr_toys_lego","cls_czr_building_kit","cls_czr_toys","cls_czr_the_world_of_children","cls_czr_click_and_collect","cls_czr_139142560","cls_czr_hobby_house_and_garden","cls_czr_household"],"hasFictiveStock":false,"originalRebateIds":["30145614"],"sellUnitSizeText":null,"countriesOfOrigin":["CZ"],"commonBrand":{"id":"26406","name":"LEGO"},"ageLimitation":null,"baseVariantQuantity":1,"articleType":0,"billName":"LEGO - 40822","pointRelevant":false,"regulatedName":"","otherLegalRequirements":"","containsMicronutrients":false,"qcommSell":null,"micronutrients":[],"matlType":"ZHAW","valClass":"Z300","ean":["5702017830865"],"vanr":"02442048008","productTagIds":[],"warengroup":"665W6111","name":"LEGO\u00ae 40822 Pick-up s halloweensk\u00fdmi d\u00fdn\u011bmi","productInHouse":{"globusBonusCredit":null,"actualPrice":279.9,"originalPrice":359.9,"discountPercentage":22,"priceValidFrom":"2026-10-06T00:00:00.000+02:00","priceValidTo":"2026-10-31T23:59:59.000+01:00","houseNumber":4005,"houseName":"Globus \u010cR, v.o.s. \u010cakovice ","placements":null,"modified":"2026-10-04T22:23:22.000+02:00","stockAmount":11,"minimumPresentationStock":0,"priceTagId":"11","priceType":"VKA0","comparisonPrice":null,"comparisonSaleUnitSizeText":null,"baseComparisonPrice":null,"baseComparisonSaleUnitSizeText":null,"securityTag":false