ou, m\u00edrn\u011b slanou chut\u00ed, s v\u00fdraznou v\u016fn\u00ed po uzen\u00ed. Na povrchu s\u00fdra jsou z\u0159eteln\u00e9 prolisy od ko\u0161\u00ed\u010dk\u016f, v nich\u017e p\u0159i v\u00fdrob\u011b hork\u00e1 pa\u0159enina vychl\u00e1d\u00e1.<br><br>S\u00fdr je ur\u010den k p\u0159\u00edm\u00e9 spot\u0159eb\u011b, jako p\u0159\u00edloha, jako dopln\u011bk lah\u016fdk\u00e1\u0159sk\u00fdch pokrm\u016f a k dal\u0161\u00edmu kulin\u00e1\u0159sk\u00e9mu zpracov\u00e1n\u00ed. Vhodn\u00fd je i k p\u0159\u00edprav\u011b tepl\u00fdch pokrm\u016f.","contains":"ML\u00c9KO, jedl\u00e1 s\u016fl, \u010dist\u00e9 ML\u00c9K\u00c1RENSK\u00c9 KULTURY, mikrobi\u00e1ln\u00ed sy\u0159idlo","imgDetail":"https:\/\/gapi.globus.cz\/OnlineAsset\/3\/asset?assetID=5ec1cb0d-4531-4d79-a38b-15bd36f0c48d&type=1","allergens":[{"name":"7. ML\u00c9KO a v\u00fdrobky z n\u011bj"}],"nutritionValues":[{"title":"atr_czr_energy_kcal_os","value":"311","unit":"","referenceUnit":"100g\/ml","name":"Energie v kcal"},{"title":"atr_czr_energy_kj_os","value":"1293","unit":"","referenceUnit":"100g\/ml","name":"Energie v kJ"},{"title":"atr_czr_carbohydrates_os","value":"3","unit":"","referenceUnit":"100g\/ml","name":"Sacharidy"},{"title":"atr_czr_sugars_os","value":"3","unit":"","referenceUnit":"100g\/ml","name":"Cukry"},{"title":"atr_czr_salt_os","value":"1.5","unit":"","referenceUnit":"100g\/ml","name":"S\u016fl"},{"title":"atr_czr_starches_os","value":"0","unit":"","referenceUnit":"100g\/ml","name":"\u0160kroby"},{"title":"atr_czr_proteins_os","value":"23","unit":"","referenceUnit":"100g\/ml","name":"B\u00edlkoviny"},{"title":"atr_czr_polyalcohols_os","value":"0","unit":"","referenceUnit":"100g\/ml","name":"Polyalkoholy"},{"title":"atr_czr_fiber_os","value":"0","unit":"","referenceUnit":"100g\/ml","name":"Vl\u00e1knina"},{"title":"atr_czr_fats_os","value":"23","unit":"","referenceUnit":"100g\/ml","name":"Tuky"},{"title":"atr_czr_saturated_fatty_acids_os","value":"13,8","unit":"","referenceUnit":"100g\