"Primator pat\u0159\u00ed mezi p\u0159\u00edrodn\u00ed s\u00fdry ement\u00e1lsk\u00e9ho typu s vysokodoh\u0159\u00edvanou s\u00fd\u0159eninou, kter\u00e9 jsou nejvydatn\u011bj\u0161\u00edm zdrojem v\u00e1pn\u00edku v na\u0161\u00ed potrav\u011b. Je lah\u016fdkou pro n\u00e1ro\u010dn\u00e9 labu\u017en\u00edky d\u00edky sv\u00e9 jemn\u00e9, mandlov\u011b nasl\u00e1dl\u00e9 chuti, je\u017e je v\u00fdsledkem modern\u00ed technologie a dlouh\u00e9ho zr\u00e1n\u00ed. Je vhodn\u00fd pro pou\u017eit\u00ed ve studen\u00e9 kuchyni na p\u0159\u00edpravu oblo\u017een\u00fdch m\u00eds, chleb\u00ed\u010dk\u016f, chu\u0165ovek \u010di pomaz\u00e1nek a sal\u00e1t\u016f. V tepl\u00e9 kuchyni najde \u0161irok\u00e9 uplatn\u011bn\u00ed p\u0159i p\u0159\u00edprav\u011b nejr\u016fzn\u011bj\u0161\u00edch s\u00fdrov\u00fdch specialit. Vyniknout jeho chuti daj\u00ed nejl\u00e9pe st\u0159edn\u011b pln\u00e1 \u010derven\u00e1 v\u00edna jako Frankovka, Rulandsk\u00e9 modr\u00e9, Beaujolais. Spl\u0148uje po\u017eadavky bezlepkov\u00e9 diety.","contains":"Tvrdy S\u00ddR. Slo\u017een\u00ed: pasterizovan\u00e9 ML\u00c9KO, jedl\u00e1 s\u016fl max. 2,5%, sy\u0159idlo, ML\u00c9K\u00c1RENSK\u00c9 KULTURY. Obsah tuku v su\u0161in\u011b 45% hm., obsah su\u0161iny 60% hm.","imgDetail":"https:\/\/gapi.globus.cz\/OnlineAsset\/3\/asset?assetID=9a1bf6a5-f81e-43af-87a6-cbcba3829c0e&type=1","allergens":[{"name":"Obsahuje: 7. ML\u00c9KO a v\u00fdrobky z n\u011bj"}],"nutritionValues":[{"title":"atr_czr_energy_kcal_os","value":"375","unit":"","referenceUnit":"100g","name":"Energie v kcal"},{"title":"atr_czr_energy_kj_os","value":"1558","unit":"","referenceUnit":"100g","name":"Energie v kJ"},{"title":"atr_czr_carbohydrates_os","value":"0.5","unit":"","referenceUnit":"100g","name":"Sacharidy"},{"title":"atr_czr_sugars_os","value":"0.5","unit":"","referenceUnit":"100g","name":"Cukry"},{"title":"atr_czr_salt_os","value":"1","unit":"","referenceUnit":"100g","name":"S\u016fl"},{"title":"atr_czr_proteins_os","value":"2