ID":null,"rabatNumber":null,"originalRebateId":null,"IsBaseVariant":false,"ribbon":{"vSale":{"display":true,"label":"-40 %"}},"badges":[],"calculatedPrice":{"currentPrice":59.9,"normalPrice":99.9}},{"brand":{"brandId":"0","name":"Norm\u00e1ln\u00ed"},"description":"- Vegetari\u00e1nsk\u00fd Garden Gourmet Veggie burger obsahuje s\u00f3jov\u00e9 a p\u0161eni\u010dn\u00e9 proteiny, ale svou vyv\u00e1\u017eenou chut\u00ed nadchne i milovn\u00edky masa. <br>- Je \u0161\u0165avnat\u00fd a skv\u011ble chutn\u00e1 jako tradi\u010dn\u00ed burger v bulce nebo pod\u00e1van\u00fd se zeleninov\u00fdm sal\u00e1tem.<br>- Je skv\u011bl\u00fdm zdrojem protein\u016f a vl\u00e1kniny.<br>- Nadchne V\u00e1s svou snadnou a rychlou p\u0159\u00edpravou na p\u00e1nvi \u010di v troub\u011b.<br>- Balen\u00ed obsahuje dv\u011b porce.<br><br>Chceme v\u00e1s inspirovat k lep\u0161\u00edmu \u017eivotu pln\u00e9mu vzru\u0161uj\u00edc\u00edch chut\u00ed. Proto v\u00e1m nab\u00edz\u00edme 6 lahodn\u00fdch vegetari\u00e1nsk\u00fdch v\u00fdrobk\u016f, kter\u00e9 zbyte\u010dn\u011b nezat\u011b\u017euj\u00ed planetu ani va\u0161e t\u011blo. Nav\u00edc obsahuj\u00ed spoustu rostlinn\u00fdch b\u00edlkovin a vl\u00e1kniny, bez kter\u00fdch se lidsk\u00e9 zdrav\u00ed zkr\u00e1tka neobejde.","contains":"Rehydratovan\u00e1 S\u00d3JOV\u00c1 b\u00edlkovina 51 %, rehydratovan\u00e1 P\u0160ENI\u010cN\u00c1 b\u00edlkovina 15,1 %, rostlinn\u00e9 oleje 7,3 % (\u0159epkov\u00fd, slune\u010dnicov\u00fd), cibule, majon\u00e9za (slune\u010dnicov\u00fd olej, kvasn\u00fd ocet lihov\u00fd, su\u0161en\u00e9 VAJE\u010cN\u00c9 \u017dLOUTKY, HO\u0158\u010cICE, jodidovan\u00e1 jedl\u00e1 s\u016fl: jedl\u00e1 s\u016fl, jodi\u010dnan draseln\u00fd; cukr), su\u0161en\u00e9 VAJE\u010cN\u00c9 B\u00cdLKY, su\u0161en\u00fd kvasni\u010dn\u00fd v\u00fdta\u017eek, sma\u017een\u00e1 su\u0161en\u00e1 cibule kousky (su\u0161en\u00e1 cibule, slune\u010dnicov\u00fd olej), pitn\u00e1 voda, kvasn\u00fd ocet lihov\u00fd, cibulov\u00fd pr\u00e1\u0161ek, jable\u010dn\u00e9 pyr\u00e9, kuku\u0159i\u010dn\u00fd \u0161krob, jedl\u00e1 s\u016fl, \u010desnekov\u00fd pr\u00e1\u0161ek, sladov\u00fd v\u00fdta\u017eek z JE\u010cMENE, sm\u011bs ko\u0159en\u00ed (\u0159\u00edmsk\u00fd km\u00edn, rozmar\u00fdn), petr\u017eelov\u00e1 na\u0165, extrakty ko\u0159en\u00ed","imgDetail":"https:\/\/gapi.globus.cz\/OnlineAsset\/3\/asset?assetID=05db3fcd-e13a-4658-bede-81b7b2a71cc1&type=1","allergens":[{"name":"Obsahuje: 1. OBILOVINY OBSAHUJ\u00cdC\u00cd LEPEK a v\u00fdrobky z nich, 3. VEJCE a v\u00fdrobky z nich, 6. S\u00d3JOV\u00c9 BOBY (S\u00d3JA) a v\u00fdrobky z nich, 10. HO\u0158\u010cICE a v\u00fdrobky z n\u00ed<br>M\u016f\u017ee obsahovat:  9. CELER a v\u00fdrobky z n\u011bj, 11. SEZAMOV\u00c1 SEMENA (SEZAM) a v\u00fdrobky z nich"}],"nutritionValues":[{"title":"atr_czr_energy_kcal_os","value":"219","unit":"","referenceUnit":"100g","name":"Energie v kcal"},{"title":"atr_czr_energy_kj_os","value":"913","unit":"","referenceUnit":"100g","name":"Energie v kJ"},{"title":"atr_czr_carbohydrates_os","value":"6.2","unit":"","referenceUnit":"100g","name":"Sacharidy"},{"title":"atr_czr_sugars_os","value":"3.2","unit":"","referenceUnit":"100g","name":"Cukry"},{"title":"atr_czr_salt_os","value":"1.4","unit":"","referenceUnit":"100g","name":"S\u016fl"},{"title":"atr_czr_proteins_os","value":"21","unit":"","referenceUnit":"100g","name":"B\u00edlkoviny"},{"title":"atr_czr_fiber_os","value":"5.5","unit":"","referenceUnit":"100g","name":"Vl\u00e1knina"},{"title":"atr_czr_fats_os","value":"11","unit":"","referenceUnit":"100g","name":"Tuky"},{"title":"atr_czr_saturated_fatty_acids_os","value":"1.2","unit":"","referenceUnit":"100g","name":"Nasycen\u00e9 mastn\u00e9 kyseliny"}],"producer":"NESTL\u00c9 \u010cESKO S.R.O.","producerId":"30102","storage":"Uchovejte v chladu p\u0159i teplot\u011b do +8 \u00b0C. Po otev\u0159en\u00ed ihned spot\u0159ebujte.","productCategories":["cls_czr_soybean_and_vege_protein","cls_czr_food_for_vegetarians_and_ve